  ],
  "duration_s": 378.531995,
  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "你知道中国历史上哪个朝代丢掉的领土最多吗？相信很多人第一反应是，清朝签了那么多不平等条约，丢了外东北丢了台湾丢了香港丢了澳门是中国人最熟悉的朝代。错，真要论起丢地的数量，清朝连前三都进不去。今天咱们就来盘点中国十大丢失领土最多的朝代。先讲第十到第六，一个比一个让人心疼。老规矩开讲之前麻烦您扣个一点个红心，让我看看都是谁在听。第十名，秦朝秦始皇统一六国，又派蒙恬带三十万大军，北击匈奴，收复河套，设了九原郡，南征百越，打了三次，设了桂林南海，相郡，把江当裕推到了三百四十万平方公里，可秦朝太短了，统一十五年就完了。秦二世昏庸，赵高专权，天下大乱，陈胜吴广一闹，北方的匈奴头曼单于趁机南下河套，又抢回去了。南边的赵佗也封官爵道，独立了，建了南越国。秦朝从统一到灭亡，前后丢了将近五十万平方公里。一个刚刚统一的王朝，还没捂热就散了，您说这是可惜还是命短？第九名隋朝隋文帝统一，南北又击败突厥控制核套，隋炀帝一度亲自带兵征服了屠骨魂，打到青海，设了西海和源善善且末四个郡，版图推到了四百六十万平方公里。可隋炀帝太急了，修大运河三征高巨丽死了几十万人，把国力耗干了，突厥又强大起来。史必可汗带兵包围雁门关。隋炀帝差点被抓，河套平原再次沦陷。吐谷浑的四个郡没几年也丢了。隋朝一共丢了，大约一百万平方公里，三十七年，一个短命王朝把家底赔了个精光。第八名，宋朝北宋疆域两百八十万平方公里，是历代大一统王朝里最小的。为什么小？因为燕云十六州丢了，那是长城防线，没了燕云北方门户大开可就是这两百八十万也没守住。金兵南下金兵之变徽清二帝被俘，三千多人被押到东北。北宋灭亡赵构，跑到江南建立南宋，只剩两百万平方公里，北方全部丢了，将近八十万平方公里。燕云十六州从后晋哥给契丹开始，到明朝才收回来丢了四百多年。岳飞想收复，被十二道金牌召回秦桧害死，从此没人再提北伐。宋朝重文轻武，有钱有文化，就是打不了仗。您说这是教训还是悲哀？第七名汉朝西汉鼎盛时期，六百零九万平方公里，汉武帝北伐匈奴收复核套，拿下河西走廊经营西域设西域都护府，可到了东汉后期西域都护府，放弃了改设西域，长使府西域，逐渐脱离控制班超经营。三十年，儿子班勇接着干，三绝三通，可国力不行了，西域还是丢了。东北那边，高句丽强大起来慢慢蚕食。汉四郡热浪悬戳真翻林屯一个一个丢两处加起来，汉朝后期一共丢了大约两百万平方公里，一个打出了汉族名字的王朝。最后，连自己打下来的地盘都守不住。第六名，西晋西晋统一三国，疆域五百四十多万平方公里，可西晋是历史上出了名的乱八王之乱。司马家族自己打自己人打了十六年，死了几十万人，打的国力空虚。北方的匈奴鲜卑结。羌五个少数民族，趁乱南下，匈奴，刘渊起兵称汉帝石勒亡迷，各路豪杰勇，加之乱洛阳丢了淮帝被俘长安，丢了朝帝投降。西晋灭亡，北方全部沦陷，东晋退到江南，只剩三百来万平方公里。西晋丢掉了北方，将近两百五十万平方公里，汉人难逃，史称衣冠难渡，从此南北分裂。您说这是内乱还是自毁长城？从第十到第六，秦朝丢了五十万，西晋丢了八百万，宋朝丢了八十万，隋朝丢了两百万，西晋丢了两百五十万可，这五个还不是丢的最多的。接下来第五到第一，一个比一个狠。有一个朝代丢了六百万平方公里，有一个朝代号称不和亲，不纳贡，不割地，可实际上丢的比谁都多。他是哪个？他凭什么排第一，下集马上更新，您先点个关注点，开头像别走丢。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_209edbff0b6b4db9_s00001",
      "start_ms": 190,
      "end_ms": 4290,
      "text": "你知道中国历史上哪个朝代丢掉的领土最多吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_209edbff0b6b4db9_s00002",
      "start_ms": 5030,
      "end_ms": 7290,
      "text": "相信很多人第一反应是，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_209edbff0b6b4db9_s00003",
      "start_ms": 7290,
      "end_ms": 10210,
      "text": "清朝签了那么多不平等条约，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_209edbff0b6b4db9_s00004",
      "start_ms": 10390,
      "end_ms": 16850,
      "text": "丢了外东北丢了台湾丢了香港丢了澳门是中国人最熟悉的朝代。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_209edbff0b6b4db9_s00005",
      "start_ms": 17650,
      "end_ms": 17890,
      "text": "错，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_209edbff0b6b4db9_s00006",
      "start_ms": 18210,
      "end_ms": 20210,
      "text": "真要论起丢地的数量，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_209edbff0b6b4db9_s00007",
      "start_ms": 20690,
      "end_ms": 23310,
      "text": "清朝连前三都进不去。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_209edbff0b6b4db9_s00008",
      "start_ms": 24090,
      "end_ms": 29785,
      "text": "今天咱们就来盘点中国十大丢失领土最多的朝代。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_209edbff0b6b4db9_s00009",
      "start_ms": 30220,
      "end_ms": 32020,
      "text": "先讲第十到第六，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_209edbff0b6b4db9_s00010",
      "start_ms": 32520,
      "end_ms": 34660,
      "text": "一个比一个让人心疼。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_209edbff0b6b4db9_s00011",
      "start_ms": 35280,
      "end_ms": 39800,
      "text": "老规矩开讲之前麻烦您扣个一点个红心，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_209edbff0b6b4db9_s00012",
      "start_ms": 40100,
      "end_ms": 42920,
      "text": "让我看看都是谁在听。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_209edbff0b6b4db9_s00013",
      "start_ms": 43340,
      "end_ms": 44060,
      "text": "第十名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_209edbff0b6b4db9_s00014",
      "start_ms": 44480,
      "end_ms": 47460,
      "text": "秦朝秦始皇统一六国，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_209edbff0b6b4db9_s00015",
      "start_ms": 47980,
      "end_ms": 50340,
      "text": "又派蒙恬带三十万大军，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_209edbff0b6b4db9_s00016",
      "start_ms": 50580,
      "end_ms": 51480,
      "text": "北击匈奴，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_209edbff0b6b4db9_s00017",
      "start_ms": 51760,
      "end_ms": 52560,
      "text": "收复河套，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_209edbff0b6b4db9_s00018",
      "start_ms": 53160,
      "end_ms": 54220,
      "text": "设了九原郡，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_209edbff0b6b4db9_s00019",
      "start_ms": 54560,
      "end_ms": 55540,
      "text": "南征百越，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_209edbff0b6b4db9_s00020",
      "start_ms": 55800,
      "end_ms": 56620,
      "text": "打了三次，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_209edbff0b6b4db9_s00021",
      "start_ms": 56960,
      "end_ms": 58600,
      "text": "设了桂林南海，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_209edbff0b6b4db9_s00022",
      "start_ms": 58640,
      "end_ms": 59140,
      "text": "相郡，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_209edbff0b6b4db9_s00023",
      "start_ms": 59520,
      "end_ms": 62715,
      "text": "把江当裕推到了三百四十万平方公里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_209edbff0b6b4db9_s00024",
      "start_ms": 63190,
      "end_ms": 64675,
      "text": "可秦朝太短了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_209edbff0b6b4db9_s00025",
      "start_ms": 65010,
      "end_ms": 66555,
      "text": "统一十五年就完了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_209edbff0b6b4db9_s00026",
      "start_ms": 67120,
      "end_ms": 68185,
      "text": "秦二世昏庸，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_209edbff0b6b4db9_s00027",
      "start_ms": 68450,
      "end_ms": 69275,
      "text": "赵高专权，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_209edbff0b6b4db9_s00028",
      "start_ms": 69620,
      "end_ms": 70505,
      "text": "天下大乱，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_209edbff0b6b4db9_s00029",
      "start_ms": 70980,
      "end_ms": 72205,
      "text": "陈胜吴广一闹，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_209edbff0b6b4db9_s00030",
      "start_ms": 72670,
      "end_ms": 76110,
      "text": "北方的匈奴头曼单于趁机南下河套，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_209edbff0b6b4db9_s00031",
      "start_ms": 76110,
      "end_ms": 77045,
      "text": "又抢回去了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_209edbff0b6b4db9_s00032",
      "start_ms": 78030,
      "end_ms": 80440,
      "text": "南边的赵佗也封官爵道，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_209edbff0b6b4db9_s00033",
      "start_ms": 80640,
      "end_ms": 81255,
      "text": "独立了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_209edbff0b6b4db9_s00034",
      "start_ms": 82100,
      "end_ms": 83295,
      "text": "建了南越国。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_209edbff0b6b4db9_s00035",
      "start_ms": 84120,
      "end_ms": 86305,
      "text": "秦朝从统一到灭亡，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_209edbff0b6b4db9_s00036",
      "start_ms": 86810,
      "end_ms": 89375,
      "text": "前后丢了将近五十万平方公里。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_209edbff0b6b4db9_s00037",
      "start_ms": 90760,
      "end_ms": 92745,
      "text": "一个刚刚统一的王朝，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_209edbff0b6b4db9_s00038",
      "start_ms": 93190,
      "end_ms": 94745,
      "text": "还没捂热就散了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_209edbff0b6b4db9_s00039",
      "start_ms": 95790,
      "end_ms": 98015,
      "text": "您说这是可惜还是命短？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_209edbff0b6b4db9_s00040",
      "start_ms": 99110,
      "end_ms": 103260,
      "text": "第九名隋朝隋文帝统一，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_209edbff0b6b4db9_s00041",
      "start_ms": 103260,
      "end_ms": 106145,
      "text": "南北又击败突厥控制核套，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_209edbff0b6b4db9_s00042",
      "start_ms": 107190,
      "end_ms": 110855,
      "text": "隋炀帝一度亲自带兵征服了屠骨魂，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_209edbff0b6b4db9_s00043",
      "start_ms": 111260,
      "end_ms": 112105,
      "text": "打到青海，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_209edbff0b6b4db9_s00044",
      "start_ms": 112430,
      "end_ms": 116445,
      "text": "设了西海和源善善且末四个郡，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_209edbff0b6b4db9_s00045",
      "start_ms": 116690,
      "end_ms": 119435,
      "text": "版图推到了四百六十万平方公里。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_209edbff0b6b4db9_s00046",
      "start_ms": 120200,
      "end_ms": 121600,
      "text": "可隋炀帝太急了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_209edbff0b6b4db9_s00047",
      "start_ms": 121760,
      "end_ms": 125920,
      "text": "修大运河三征高巨丽死了几十万人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_209edbff0b6b4db9_s00048",
      "start_ms": 126160,
      "end_ms": 127520,
      "text": "把国力耗干了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_209edbff0b6b4db9_s00049",
      "start_ms": 128360,
      "end_ms": 130520,
      "text": "突厥又强大起来。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_209edbff0b6b4db9_s00050",
      "start_ms": 130880,
      "end_ms": 133340,
      "text": "史必可汗带兵包围雁门关。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_209edbff0b6b4db9_s00051",
      "start_ms": 134040,
      "end_ms": 135480,
      "text": "隋炀帝差点被抓，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_209edbff0b6b4db9_s00052",
      "start_ms": 136360,
      "end_ms": 138300,
      "text": "河套平原再次沦陷。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_209edbff0b6b4db9_s00053",
      "start_ms": 139100,
      "end_ms": 141960,
      "text": "吐谷浑的四个郡没几年也丢了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_209edbff0b6b4db9_s00054",
      "start_ms": 142680,
      "end_ms": 144000,
      "text": "隋朝一共丢了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_209edbff0b6b4db9_s00055",
      "start_ms": 144000,
      "end_ms": 145960,
      "text": "大约一百万平方公里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_209edbff0b6b4db9_s00056",
      "start_ms": 146260,
      "end_ms": 147160,
      "text": "三十七年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_209edbff0b6b4db9_s00057",
      "start_ms": 148360,
      "end_ms": 152500,
      "text": "一个短命王朝把家底赔了个精光。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_209edbff0b6b4db9_s00058",
      "start_ms": 153660,
      "end_ms": 154420,
      "text": "第八名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_209edbff0b6b4db9_s00059",
      "start_ms": 154780,
      "end_ms": 160420,
      "text": "宋朝北宋疆域两百八十万平方公里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_209edbff0b6b4db9_s00060",
      "start_ms": 160420,
      "end_ms": 163040,
      "text": "是历代大一统王朝里最小的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_209edbff0b6b4db9_s00061",
      "start_ms": 163280,
      "end_ms": 164000,
      "text": "为什么小？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_209edbff0b6b4db9_s00062",
      "start_ms": 164280,
      "end_ms": 165960,
      "text": "因为燕云十六州丢了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_209edbff0b6b4db9_s00063",
      "start_ms": 166140,
      "end_ms": 167580,
      "text": "那是长城防线，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_209edbff0b6b4db9_s00064",
      "start_ms": 168020,
      "end_ms": 173380,
      "text": "没了燕云北方门户大开可就是这两百八十万也没守住。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_209edbff0b6b4db9_s00065",
      "start_ms": 174360,
      "end_ms": 179555,
      "text": "金兵南下金兵之变徽清二帝被俘，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_209edbff0b6b4db9_s00066",
      "start_ms": 180240,
      "end_ms": 182465,
      "text": "三千多人被押到东北。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_209edbff0b6b4db9_s00067",
      "start_ms": 183320,
      "end_ms": 185615,
      "text": "北宋灭亡赵构，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_209edbff0b6b4db9_s00068",
      "start_ms": 185880,
      "end_ms": 188525,
      "text": "跑到江南建立南宋，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_209edbff0b6b4db9_s00069",
      "start_ms": 188810,
      "end_ms": 190605,
      "text": "只剩两百万平方公里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_209edbff0b6b4db9_s00070",
      "start_ms": 191240,
      "end_ms": 192705,
      "text": "北方全部丢了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_209edbff0b6b4db9_s00071",
      "start_ms": 193000,
      "end_ms": 194875,
      "text": "将近八十万平方公里。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_209edbff0b6b4db9_s00072",
      "start_ms": 195300,
      "end_ms": 199055,
      "text": "燕云十六州从后晋哥给契丹开始，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_209edbff0b6b4db9_s00073",
      "start_ms": 199370,
      "end_ms": 202355,
      "text": "到明朝才收回来丢了四百多年。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_209edbff0b6b4db9_s00074",
      "start_ms": 202840,
      "end_ms": 203945,
      "text": "岳飞想收复，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_209edbff0b6b4db9_s00075",
      "start_ms": 204390,
      "end_ms": 207205,
      "text": "被十二道金牌召回秦桧害死，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_209edbff0b6b4db9_s00076",
      "start_ms": 207890,
      "end_ms": 209765,
      "text": "从此没人再提北伐。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_209edbff0b6b4db9_s00077",
      "start_ms": 210170,
      "end_ms": 211745,
      "text": "宋朝重文轻武，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_209edbff0b6b4db9_s00078",
      "start_ms": 212090,
      "end_ms": 213825,
      "text": "有钱有文化，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_209edbff0b6b4db9_s00079",
      "start_ms": 215370,
      "end_ms": 216355,
      "text": "就是打不了仗。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_209edbff0b6b4db9_s00080",
      "start_ms": 216820,
      "end_ms": 218945,
      "text": "您说这是教训还是悲哀？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_209edbff0b6b4db9_s00081",
      "start_ms": 220050,
      "end_ms": 224025,
      "text": "第七名汉朝西汉鼎盛时期，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_209edbff0b6b4db9_s00082",
      "start_ms": 224370,
      "end_ms": 226475,
      "text": "六百零九万平方公里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_209edbff0b6b4db9_s00083",
      "start_ms": 227360,
      "end_ms": 230265,
      "text": "汉武帝北伐匈奴收复核套，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_209edbff0b6b4db9_s00084",
      "start_ms": 230550,
      "end_ms": 234875,
      "text": "拿下河西走廊经营西域设西域都护府，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_209edbff0b6b4db9_s00085",
      "start_ms": 235640,
      "end_ms": 238240,
      "text": "可到了东汉后期西域都护府，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_209edbff0b6b4db9_s00086",
      "start_ms": 238260,
      "end_ms": 240100,
      "text": "放弃了改设西域，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_209edbff0b6b4db9_s00087",
      "start_ms": 240100,
      "end_ms": 241380,
      "text": "长使府西域，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_209edbff0b6b4db9_s00088",
      "start_ms": 241420,
      "end_ms": 244310,
      "text": "逐渐脱离控制班超经营。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_209edbff0b6b4db9_s00089",
      "start_ms": 244310,
      "end_ms": 244885,
      "text": "三十年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_209edbff0b6b4db9_s00090",
      "start_ms": 245110,
      "end_ms": 246315,
      "text": "儿子班勇接着干，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_209edbff0b6b4db9_s00091",
      "start_ms": 247180,
      "end_ms": 248255,
      "text": "三绝三通，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_209edbff0b6b4db9_s00092",
      "start_ms": 248510,
      "end_ms": 249535,
      "text": "可国力不行了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_209edbff0b6b4db9_s00093",
      "start_ms": 249780,
      "end_ms": 250845,
      "text": "西域还是丢了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_209edbff0b6b4db9_s00094",
      "start_ms": 251850,
      "end_ms": 252615,
      "text": "东北那边，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_209edbff0b6b4db9_s00095",
      "start_ms": 253870,
      "end_ms": 256755,
      "text": "高句丽强大起来慢慢蚕食。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_209edbff0b6b4db9_s00096",
      "start_ms": 257220,
      "end_ms": 264985,
      "text": "汉四郡热浪悬戳真翻林屯一个一个丢两处加起来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_209edbff0b6b4db9_s00097",
      "start_ms": 265590,
      "end_ms": 269755,
      "text": "汉朝后期一共丢了大约两百万平方公里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_209edbff0b6b4db9_s00098",
      "start_ms": 270730,
      "end_ms": 273105,
      "text": "一个打出了汉族名字的王朝。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_209edbff0b6b4db9_s00099",
      "start_ms": 273680,
      "end_ms": 274080,
      "text": "最后，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_209edbff0b6b4db9_s00100",
      "start_ms": 274160,
      "end_ms": 276325,
      "text": "连自己打下来的地盘都守不住。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_209edbff0b6b4db9_s00101",
      "start_ms": 277710,
      "end_ms": 278315,
      "text": "第六名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_209edbff0b6b4db9_s00102",
      "start_ms": 279600,
      "end_ms": 282770,
      "text": "西晋西晋统一三国，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_209edbff0b6b4db9_s00103",
      "start_ms": 282950,
      "end_ms": 285515,
      "text": "疆域五百四十多万平方公里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_209edbff0b6b4db9_s00104",
      "start_ms": 286450,
      "end_ms": 290185,
      "text": "可西晋是历史上出了名的乱八王之乱。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_209edbff0b6b4db9_s00105",
      "start_ms": 290860,
      "end_ms": 294120,
      "text": "司马家族自己打自己人打了十六年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_209edbff0b6b4db9_s00106",
      "start_ms": 294320,
      "end_ms": 295365,
      "text": "死了几十万人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_209edbff0b6b4db9_s00107",
      "start_ms": 296030,
      "end_ms": 297165,
      "text": "打的国力空虚。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_209edbff0b6b4db9_s00108",
      "start_ms": 297510,
      "end_ms": 300635,
      "text": "北方的匈奴鲜卑结。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_209edbff0b6b4db9_s00109",
      "start_ms": 301130,
      "end_ms": 302850,
      "text": "羌五个少数民族，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_209edbff0b6b4db9_s00110",
      "start_ms": 303090,
      "end_ms": 304050,
      "text": "趁乱南下，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_209edbff0b6b4db9_s00111",
      "start_ms": 304770,
      "end_ms": 305310,
      "text": "匈奴，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_209edbff0b6b4db9_s00112",
      "start_ms": 305350,
      "end_ms": 308970,
      "text": "刘渊起兵称汉帝石勒亡迷，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_209edbff0b6b4db9_s00113",
      "start_ms": 309910,
      "end_ms": 311390,
      "text": "各路豪杰勇，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_209edbff0b6b4db9_s00114",
      "start_ms": 311410,
      "end_ms": 315670,
      "text": "加之乱洛阳丢了淮帝被俘长安，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_209edbff0b6b4db9_s00115",
      "start_ms": 315710,
      "end_ms": 317290,
      "text": "丢了朝帝投降。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_209edbff0b6b4db9_s00116",
      "start_ms": 317630,
      "end_ms": 318530,
      "text": "西晋灭亡，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_209edbff0b6b4db9_s00117",
      "start_ms": 319350,
      "end_ms": 320630,
      "text": "北方全部沦陷，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_209edbff0b6b4db9_s00118",
      "start_ms": 321350,
      "end_ms": 322730,
      "text": "东晋退到江南，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_209edbff0b6b4db9_s00119",
      "start_ms": 322850,
      "end_ms": 325170,
      "text": "只剩三百来万平方公里。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_209edbff0b6b4db9_s00120",
      "start_ms": 325970,
      "end_ms": 327510,
      "text": "西晋丢掉了北方，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_209edbff0b6b4db9_s00121",
      "start_ms": 327790,
      "end_ms": 330595,
      "text": "将近两百五十万平方公里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_209edbff0b6b4db9_s00122",
      "start_ms": 331310,
      "end_ms": 332350,
      "text": "汉人难逃，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_209edbff0b6b4db9_s00123",
      "start_ms": 332670,
      "end_ms": 334430,
      "text": "史称衣冠难渡，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_209edbff0b6b4db9_s00124",
      "start_ms": 334730,
      "end_ms": 336410,
      "text": "从此南北分裂。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_209edbff0b6b4db9_s00125",
      "start_ms": 337070,
      "end_ms": 340250,
      "text": "您说这是内乱还是自毁长城？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_209edbff0b6b4db9_s00126",
      "start_ms": 340810,
      "end_ms": 342210,
      "text": "从第十到第六，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_209edbff0b6b4db9_s00127",
      "start_ms": 342710,
      "end_ms": 344250,
      "text": "秦朝丢了五十万，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_209edbff0b6b4db9_s00128",
      "start_ms": 344670,
      "end_ms": 346230,
      "text": "西晋丢了八百万，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_209edbff0b6b4db9_s00129",
      "start_ms": 346490,
      "end_ms": 347970,
      "text": "宋朝丢了八十万，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_209edbff0b6b4db9_s00130",
      "start_ms": 348270,
      "end_ms": 349690,
      "text": "隋朝丢了两百万，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_209edbff0b6b4db9_s00131",
      "start_ms": 350070,
      "end_ms": 352630,
      "text": "西晋丢了两百五十万可，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_209edbff0b6b4db9_s00132",
      "start_ms": 352630,
      "end_ms": 355430,
      "text": "这五个还不是丢的最多的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_209edbff0b6b4db9_s00133",
      "start_ms": 355670,
      "end_ms": 357230,
      "text": "接下来第五到第一，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_209edbff0b6b4db9_s00134",
      "start_ms": 357530,
      "end_ms": 358670,
      "text": "一个比一个狠。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_209edbff0b6b4db9_s00135",
      "start_ms": 358910,
      "end_ms": 361765,
      "text": "有一个朝代丢了六百万平方公里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_209edbff0b6b4db9_s00136",
      "start_ms": 362280,
      "end_ms": 364460,
      "text": "有一个朝代号称不和亲，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_209edbff0b6b4db9_s00137",
      "start_ms": 364560,
      "end_ms": 365100,
      "text": "不纳贡，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_209edbff0b6b4db9_s00138",
      "start_ms": 365160,
      "end_ms": 365845,
      "text": "不割地，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_209edbff0b6b4db9_s00139",
      "start_ms": 366480,
      "end_ms": 368595,
      "text": "可实际上丢的比谁都多。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_209edbff0b6b4db9_s00140",
      "start_ms": 369370,
      "end_ms": 370075,
      "text": "他是哪个？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_209edbff0b6b4db9_s00141",
      "start_ms": 370340,
      "end_ms": 371595,
      "text": "他凭什么排第一，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_209edbff0b6b4db9_s00142",
      "start_ms": 371950,
      "end_ms": 373485,
      "text": "下集马上更新，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_209edbff0b6b4db9_s00143",
      "start_ms": 373940,
      "end_ms": 375400,
      "text": "您先点个关注点，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_209edbff0b6b4db9_s00144",
      "start_ms": 375400,
      "end_ms": 378365,
      "text": "开头像别走丢。"
    }
  ],
